OL,3,GNEWSAI want to know if toxic lagoon
OL,4,Afire caused my husband's rare deadly
OL,5,Acancer
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was a sight which struck terror into
OL,8,Fthe firefighters called to tackle it -
OL,9,Fa blazing chemical waste lagoon on
OL,10,Ffire, with barrels exploding into the
OL,11,Fair.
OL,13,FSteve Williams, then in his 20s, was
OL,14,Fone of 60 firefighters sent to tackle
OL,15,Fthe burning Llwyneinion lagoon in
OL,16,FAugust 1980, which was sending thick
OL,17,Fblack smoke over a nearby village.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
