OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAI want to know if toxic lagoon
OL,4,Afire caused my husband's rare deadly
OL,5,Acancer
OL,6,
OL,7,FSteve slipped in and, although he was
OL,8,Fpulled out, his widow thinks what he
OL,9,Fswallowed may have cost him his life
OL,10,Ffrom a rare form of lung cancer aged
OL,11,F39. She said "someone should be held
OL,12,Faccountable".
OL,14,FWrexham council, which owns the site,
OL,15,Fsaid while it did not meet the legal
OL,16,Fdefinition of "contaminated land", it
OL,17,Fregularly inspected and monitored the
OL,18,Farea.
